{"id":"d5efa7f1921acf417dc2a03813924c4990d5a17a","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242575","title":"感觉程序员们把 AI 看得太重了，搞得好像离了 AI 就活不下去一样。","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"seafog","excerpt":"程序员 - @seafog - 事实上生活里的大部分人也没用 AI ，也活得好好的呢。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>事实上生活里的大部分人也没用 AI ，也活得好好的呢。</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094325\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3ce6/6ee4/680166_normal.png?m=1750412011\" alt=\"BennnnJi\" data-uid=\"680166\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BennnnJi\">BennnnJi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:08:15 +08:00\">21h 6m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 30</span>\n                    \n                    <p>生活里大部分人也不用 Git 、Docker 、IDE ，不也活得好好的。问题是他们也不靠写代码吃饭。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094348\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/af5e/0385/651753_normal.png?m=1695968108\" alt=\"sleek7671\" data-uid=\"651753\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sleek7671\">sleek7671</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:13:03 +08:00\">21h 1m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>问题是，如果离了 ai ，还按 ai 在手的效率要求干活呢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094354\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4dfa/8c1c/38436_normal.png?m=1789163514\" alt=\"msg7086\" data-uid=\"38436\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/msg7086\">msg7086</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:13:28 +08:00\">21h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>离了 AI 可以送外卖开出租，确实能活下去。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094355\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/deeb/96cc/383741_normal.png?m=1758848150\" alt=\"jingcoco\" data-uid=\"383741\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jingcoco\">jingcoco</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:13:37 +08:00\">21h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这锅不应该是 美国 openai, anthropic/ 郭嘉政策, deepseek,glm minimax 搞的吗......</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094367\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0da9/0dad/455979_normal.png?m=1764993754\" alt=\"LittleControl\" data-uid=\"455979\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/LittleControl\">LittleControl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:15:12 +08:00\">20h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>标题说了不是程序员吗， 事实上生活中的大部分人也不是程序员  <br>只不过现在 AI 把编程效率提上来了  <br>你看如果 AI 能够直观的把销售业绩提上去的话，你说他们会不会看的很重呢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094378\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/64d6/6ac2/51170_normal.png?m=1784387864\" alt=\"Tink\" data-uid=\"51170\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tink\">Tink</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:16:48 +08:00\">20h 57m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>已经不会写代码了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094384\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11bd/dd70/494150_normal.png?m=1632640634\" alt=\"sadfasdfa\" data-uid=\"494150\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sadfasdfa\">sadfasdfa</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:17:47 +08:00\">20h 56m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>那是你没遇到 Leader 塞给你一大堆活，不用 AI 根本做不完的情况</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094385\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d77c204b9fb7c9057e81140190276a29?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"fredweili\" data-uid=\"636914\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fredweili\">fredweili</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:17:48 +08:00\">20h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>他们不知道用 AI 可以把事情做的更好更容易，不愿学不会学而已</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094430\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1203/d5ab/468467_normal.png?m=1765818143\" alt=\"Pending\" data-uid=\"468467\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Pending\">Pending</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:25:18 +08:00\">20h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>骗你的，有 AI 也活不下去</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094447\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b8ce/9f31/585950_normal.png?m=1745484378\" alt=\"jonty\" data-uid=\"585950\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jonty\">jonty</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:28:27 +08:00\">20h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>逻辑极其混乱...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094517\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6159/9999/582231_normal.png?m=1754617848\" alt=\"Nasdaq\" data-uid=\"582231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Nasdaq\">Nasdaq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:38:30 +08:00\">20h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>送外卖步行也可以、自行车也可以、电动车也可以、无人机也可以</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094521\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d92e/7173/175311_normal.png?m=1759030105\" alt=\"Mogugugugu\" data-uid=\"175311\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Mogugugugu\">Mogugugugu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:39:25 +08:00\">20h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉外卖员们把 小电驴 看得太重了，搞得好像离了 小电驴 就活不下去一样。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094566\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3590/0a98/173969_normal.png?m=1747363963\" alt=\"coderluan\" data-uid=\"173969\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coderluan\">coderluan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:46:45 +08:00\">20h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉楼主把逻辑看的太轻了，虽然没逻辑也能发帖，但是肯定免不了被被人嘲笑。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094624\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3da6/bca1/579014_normal.png?m=1655454180\" alt=\"xubeiyou\" data-uid=\"579014\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xubeiyou\">xubeiyou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:53:19 +08:00\">20h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没 ai 梳理东西  做一些简易但繁琐的 挺麻烦的   没 ai 我现在工作应该很累很累且完成的不会很好</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094638\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/23e4bf904c05c912591dbed3d858189e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nullpointerskz\" data-uid=\"291045\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nullpointerskz\">nullpointerskz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:54:21 +08:00\">20h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你是不是搞不清楚 AI 带来的生产力的突破和历史机遇啊？你个不学习不进步的老登。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094676\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9aa2/c785/509562_normal.png?m=1770344834\" alt=\"anglelengyu\" data-uid=\"509562\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/anglelengyu\">anglelengyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 09:59:31 +08:00\">20h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>跟程序员遇到问题只翻书找错误而不使用互联网上面快速搜错误原因一样。都可以达到目的，一个是 1 小时，一个是 10 分钟</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094974\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/373d/0b43/370999_normal.png?m=1781235606\" alt=\"cameco\" data-uid=\"370999\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cameco\">cameco</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 10:27:32 +08:00\">19h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不是我们必须要用，而是任务时间线逼的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18094997\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d087/7338/378303_normal.png?m=1766458908\" alt=\"unco020511\" data-uid=\"378303\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/unco020511\">unco020511</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 10:29:27 +08:00\">19h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>程序员现在离开 AI 怎么写代码?我是写不了一点</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095186\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6407/57f2/791213_normal.png?m=1772691973\" alt=\"evilHa\" data-uid=\"791213\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/evilHa\">evilHa</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 10:47:09 +08:00\">19h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>程序员是不是把 IDE 看的太重了，搞得好像里了 IDE 就写不了代码一样，用 vim 一样能写嘛</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095202\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/837c7adad2a92281f9a4b84e00b1dace?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"microscopec\" data-uid=\"688419\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/microscopec\">microscopec</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 10:48:33 +08:00\">19h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉老登们把 女人 看得太重了，搞得好像离了 女人 就活不下去一样。<br>事实上生活里的大部分人也没干 女人 ，也活得好好的呢。<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095254\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8265d71e0201e39eae177837f0140ad2?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cyningxu\" data-uid=\"572794\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cyningxu\">cyningxu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 10:54:24 +08:00\">19h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉程序员们把高级语言看得太重了，搞得好像离了高级语言用汇编就活不下去一样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095470\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/01b16eedc98f475349f21468d037f78d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"fj19\" data-uid=\"351081\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fj19\">fj19</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 11:14:48 +08:00\">18h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用上了就离不开了。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095488\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2f37/d101/658_normal.png?m=1712758017\" alt=\"kuber\" data-uid=\"658\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kuber\">kuber</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 11:17:15 +08:00\">18h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>OP 应该不是程序员，不写代码的，所以有这个疑问。<br>原谅他/她/祂吧，因为他他/她/祂不知道自己在问什么。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095534\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/096e4a7dd94423358c6d4aa94a8bd70f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Rickkkkkkk\" data-uid=\"287234\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Rickkkkkkk\">Rickkkkkkk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 11:23:31 +08:00\">18h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>用过 AI 写代码就不会这么说</p><p>类似于你用记事本写代码，能不能写，确实可以</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095710\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e7ae/d502/598387_normal.png?m=1681798579\" alt=\"carverReal\" data-uid=\"598387\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/carverReal\">carverReal</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 11:46:11 +08:00\">18h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>不是，你能这么类比的嘛？</p><p>OP 每天只要热量满足 3000 大卡，也能活得好好的呢</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095774\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4905e89729bb86da5d987b866431d47a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"chapiom\" data-uid=\"410900\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chapiom\">chapiom</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 11:58:57 +08:00\">18h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这就像有了洗碗机，再也不想手工洗碗了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095781\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7c5f/dee5/501491_normal.png?m=1740538740\" alt=\"gl3081\" data-uid=\"501491\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gl3081\">gl3081</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 11:59:51 +08:00\">18h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>天才程序员与普通程序员中间只差个 AI</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095879\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/08d92793c67debd121be513cea9e4e10?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"momo1pm\" data-uid=\"360642\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/momo1pm\">momo1pm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 12:46:55 +08:00\">17h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是老板需要 ai ，不是牛马需要 ai</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18095883\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/22e777782785300e581bd61321ff3c04?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xyyxlq\" data-uid=\"301755\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xyyxlq\">xyyxlq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 12:48:27 +08:00\">17h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉滴滴司机们把车看得太重了，搞得好像离了车就活不下去一样。<br>事实上生活里的大部分人也没有车，也活得好好的呢。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18096095\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ff542cb1df396ce58e322fb289450ab1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Youkexin\" data-uid=\"689137\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Youkexin\">Youkexin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 13:45:03 +08:00\">16h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>确实活不了啊, 没 AI 怎么干活? 还要不要赚钱了, 当然离不开</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18096156\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11fd/f78f/381769_normal.png?m=1756285447\" alt=\"cuicuiv5\" data-uid=\"381769\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cuicuiv5\">cuicuiv5</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 13:55:52 +08:00\">16h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>给你买个 chatgpt pro 20x 用用就老实了 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18097472\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/588a9e330b8460d19710e29c75c65f5f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"seafog\" data-uid=\"632985\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>39</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/seafog\">seafog</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 17:19:43 +08:00\">12h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/kuber\">kuber</a> 的确不是程序员，平时也不用 ai ，不用 ai 确实对我的生活工作没啥影响。没觉得我说这句话伤害了谁，还要求别人原谅也太可笑了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18097485\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/588a9e330b8460d19710e29c75c65f5f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"seafog\" data-uid=\"632985\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/seafog\">seafog</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 17:21:27 +08:00\">12h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/chapiom\">chapiom</a> 那我就想问了，我就一个碗，我自己手洗一分钟就洗完了，然后贴脸跟我说说「你不用洗碗机你就完了」，这话对我来说就是一种末日危机论啊。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18097842\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9d7c/f536/666685_normal.png?m=1763005722\" alt=\"vegeta2ex\" data-uid=\"666685\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vegeta2ex\">vegeta2ex</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-17 19:21:28 +08:00\">10h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在没有 ai 真没法干活了，用上了就回不去了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"事实上生活里的大部分人也没用 AI ，也活得好好的呢。 1 BennnnJi 21h 6m ago 30 生活里大部分人也不用 Git 、Docker 、IDE ，不也活得好好的。问题是他们也不靠写代码吃饭。 3 sleek7671 21h 1m ago 2 问题是，如果离了 ai ，还按 ai 在手的效率要求干活呢 5 msg7086 21h 1m ago 离了 AI 可以送外卖开出租，确实能活下去。 6 jingcoco 21h 1m ago 这锅不应该是 美国 openai, anthropic/ 郭嘉政策, deepseek,glm minimax 搞的吗...... 7 LittleControl 20h 59m ago 标题说了不是程序员吗， 事实上生活中的大部分人也不是程序员 只不过现在 AI 把编程效率提上来了 你看如果 AI 能够直观的把销售业绩提上去的话，你说他们会不会看的很重呢 8 Tink 20h 57m ago 1 已经不会写代码了 9 sadfasdfa 20h 56m ago via iPhone 那是你没遇到 Leader 塞给你一大堆活，不用 AI 根本做不完的情况 10 fredweili 20h 56m ago 他们不知道用 AI 可以把事情做的更好更容易，不愿学不会学而已 12 Pending 20h 49m ago 骗你的，有 AI 也活不下去 14 jonty 20h 46m ago 逻辑极其混乱... 15 Nasdaq 20h 36m ago 送外卖步行也可以、自行车也可以、电动车也可以、无人机也可以 16 Mogugugugu 20h 35m ago 感觉外卖员们把 小电驴 看得太重了，搞得好像离了 小电驴 就活不下去一样。 17 coderluan 20h 27m ago 感觉楼主把逻辑看的太轻了，虽然没逻辑也能发帖，但是肯定免不了被被人嘲笑。 18 xubeiyou 20h 21m ago 没 ai 梳理东西 做一些简易但繁琐的 挺麻烦的 没 ai 我现在工作应该很累很累且完成的不会很好 19 nullpointerskz 20h 20m ago 你是不是搞不清楚 AI 带来的生产力的突破和历史机遇啊？你个不学习不进步的老登。 20 anglelengyu 20h 15m ago 跟程序员遇到问题只翻书找错误而不使用互联网上面快速搜错误原因一样。都可以达到目的，一个是 1 小时，一个是 10 分钟 22 cameco 19h 47m ago 不是我们必须要用，而是任务时间线逼的。 23 unco020511 19h 45m ago 程序员现在离开 AI 怎么写代码?我是写不了一点 25 evilHa 19h 27m ago 程序员是不是把 IDE 看的太重了，搞得好像里了 IDE 就写不了代码一样，用 vim 一样能写嘛 26 microscopec 19h 26m ago 感觉老登们把 女人 看得太重了，搞得好像离了 女人 就活不下去一样。事实上生活里的大部分人也没干 女人 ，也活得好好的呢。 27 cyningxu 19h 20m ago 感觉程序员们把高级语言看得太重了，搞得好像离了高级语言用汇编就活不下去一样 28 fj19 18h 59m ago 用上了就离不开了。。 29 kuber 18h 57m ago OP 应该不是程序员，不写代码的，所以有这个疑问。原谅他/她/祂吧，因为他他/她/祂不知道自己在问什么。 30 Rickkkkkkk 18h 51m ago 用过 AI 写代码就不会这么说类似于你用记事本写代码，能不能写，确实可以 31 carverReal 18h 28m ago 不是，你能这么类比的嘛？OP 每天只要热量满足 3000 大卡，也能活得好好的呢 32 chapiom 18h 15m ago 这就像有了洗碗机，再也不想手工洗碗了。 33 gl3081 18h 14m ago 天才程序员与普通程序员中间只差个 AI 34 momo1pm 17h 27m ago 是老板需要 ai ，不是牛马需要 ai 35 xyyxlq 17h 26m ago 感觉滴滴司机们把车看得太重了，搞得好像离了车就活不下去一样。事实上生活里的大部分人也没有车，也活得好好的呢。 36 Youkexin 16h 29m ago 确实活不了啊, 没 AI 怎么干活? 还要不要赚钱了, 当然离不开 37 cuicuiv5 16h 18m ago 给你买个 chatgpt pro 20x 用用就老实了 39 seafog OP 12h 54m ago @kuber 的确不是程序员，平时也不用 ai ，不用 ai 确实对我的生活工作没啥影响。没觉得我说这句话伤害了谁，还要求别人原谅也太可笑了。 40 seafog OP 12h 53m ago @chapiom 那我就想问了，我就一个碗，我自己手洗一分钟就洗完了，然后贴脸跟我说说「你不用洗碗机你就完了」，这话对我来说就是一种末日危机论啊。 41 vegeta2ex 10h 53m ago 现在没有 ai 真没法干活了，用上了就回不去了","fetched_at":"2026-09-17T22:16:01.120Z","ok":true}